<title>UK: BHF Bank sets 100 mln mark two-year bond.</title>
<headline>BHF Bank sets 100 mln mark two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced on Tuesday by lead manager Berliner Handels- und Frankfurter Bank for itself.</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     2.80	MATURITY    28.MAY.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.00     PAY DATE    28.APR.97</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    LISTING    FRANKFURT PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 1	   HOME CTRY   GERMANY</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
